## 4. Recommended Project Structure

Create a clean build folder before packaging the application.

```text
SAPTicketAssistant/
├── sap_ticket_assistant.py
├── assets/
│   └── sap_ticket_assistant.ico
├── build/
├── dist/
└── installer/
```

The `build` and `dist` directories are normally generated by PyInstaller. The `installer` directory can contain the WiX, Inno Setup, or Advanced Installer project files.

> The icon is optional. If an icon is used, Windows packaging works most reliably with a valid `.ico` file that contains multiple resolutions.

