## 21. Upgrade Strategy

Use a predictable versioning and upgrade process.

Recommended release flow:

1. Update the application version.
2. Update release notes.
3. Run application tests from source.
4. Build a clean EXE.
5. Test the EXE without Python installed.
6. Sign the EXE.
7. Build the MSI.
8. Test a fresh installation.
9. Test an upgrade from the previous supported version.
10. Test uninstallation.
11. Confirm existing ticket data is preserved.
12. Sign and publish the approved MSI.

Do not change the MSI upgrade code between normal product releases. Configure the installer so that downgrades are blocked unless the support process explicitly allows them.

